1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,386
Ops manager ka pehla tool — Sales tab.

2
00:00:02,386 --> 00:00:05,086
Yaha aap har sales voucher dekh sakte hain.

3
00:00:05,086 --> 00:00:08,917
Upar filters hain — date range, salesman, customer, category.

4
00:00:08,917 --> 00:00:11,555
Filter lagate hi list update ho jaati hai.

5
00:00:11,555 --> 00:00:15,134
Kisi bhi voucher pe click kariye — details khul jaayenge.

6
00:00:15,134 --> 00:00:17,144
Items, quantities, rates, total.

7
00:00:17,144 --> 00:00:19,907
Do buttons upar hain — PDF aur Excel export.

8
00:00:19,907 --> 00:00:24,115
Dono files aapki company name ke header ke saath download hoti hain

9
00:00:24,115 --> 00:00:25,747
professional look ke liye.

10
00:00:25,747 --> 00:00:29,139
Ek pro tip Salesman filter lagakar Excel export kariye

11
00:00:29,139 --> 00:00:33,158
aur monthly performance review ke liye salesman ko share kariye.

12
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:33,911
Bahut asaan.
